1
00:00:02,419 --> 00:00:05,709
(Howard:)All right, that's the last servo.

2
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:11,010
(Howard:)Behold the Mobile Omnidirectional
Neutralization and Termination Eradicator.

3
00:00:11,177 --> 00:00:12,217
(Howard:)Or...

4
00:00:12,387 --> 00:00:14,427
ALL:
Monte.

5
00:00:15,098 --> 00:00:17,848
(Howard:)Featuring one articulated
razor-sharp killing saw...

6
00:00:18,018 --> 00:00:19,728
...one polycarbonate grinding wheel...

7
00:00:19,894 --> 00:00:22,104
...steel-armor plate exoskeleton
top and bottom.

8
00:00:22,272 --> 00:00:25,112
(Howard:)Enough horsepower to drive
110 pounds of mechanized death...

9
00:00:25,275 --> 00:00:29,195
(Howard:)...from zero to holy crap in 4.8 seconds.

10
00:00:29,362 --> 00:00:33,032
(Sheldon:)Is it wrong to say I love our killer robot?

11
00:00:33,199 --> 00:00:36,909
(Raj:)As with my father,
I both love and fear it.

12
00:00:37,078 --> 00:00:39,958
(Howard:)All right, enough chitchat.
Let's destroy something.

13
00:00:40,415 --> 00:00:42,125
ALL:
One, two, three. Unh.

14
00:00:42,292 --> 00:00:45,292
RAJESH: Okay, what shall be first
to taste the wrath of Monte?

15
00:00:45,462 --> 00:00:47,042
(Leonard:)Maybe we should start small.

16
00:00:47,547 --> 00:00:50,637
RAJESH: Okay. Oh, perhaps today
is the day we finally find out...

17
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:53,680
...what's inside the Magic 8 Ball.

18
00:00:54,095 --> 00:00:55,345
Did it when I was 4.

19
00:00:55,513 --> 00:00:58,933
It's an icosahedral die
floating in tinted blue water.

20
00:00:59,350 --> 00:01:03,650
(Raj:)Man, call spoiler alert
before you say things like that.

